    <string name="confirm_forget_detail">It will start suggesting other words for them again, and the fixes it has counted start again from nothing. Rules and text shortcuts stay as they are. This cannot be undone.</string>
    <string name="confirm_reset">Put every setting back to normal?</string>
    <string name="confirm_reset_detail">Apps with their own settings go back to the usual ones. Learned words, fix counts, shortcuts and clipboard history stay as they are.</string>
